WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.820 line:73%
Bakit hindi umaabot sa
rated watts ang panels mo?

c02
00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.940 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:10.500 line:73%
Ang rating ay galing sa lab
test: standard test conditions.

c04
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:16.930 line:73%
1000 W/m² na liwanag at
25°C na cell temperature.

c05
00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:20.410 line:73%
Sa totoong bubong,
mas mainit ang panels,

c06
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.850 line:73%
at kapag mas mainit,
bumababa ang output.

c07
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:28.180 line:73%
May epekto rin ang anino,
alikabok, at anggulo ng araw.

c08
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.830 line:73%
Kaya normal na mas mababa
ang aktwal kaysa rating.

cz1
00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:37.710 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.470 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
